WEBVTT

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.360
I can't get any closer.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.460
How may I--?

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:06.270
That was quick.

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:17.610
Gross.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.540
Yeah, we're all set here.

00:01:27.830 --> 00:01:29.380
Get the target

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.210
when they escort him out.

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.210
<i>The diversion will only last a moment.</i>

00:01:36.510 --> 00:01:38.470
<i>Our new orders are to kill on sight.</i>

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:47.270
Do it quickly.

00:03:20.110 --> 00:03:21.360
You caused quite a scene.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.780
There were two attacks.

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:30.620
The first attack we initiated.

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.420
The second was when my man was attacked

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.460
by a completely different group.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:39.300
And the attackers?

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:46.510
To make matters worse,
they killed the men we captured.

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.640
Is the material witness safe?

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:54.900
James took him in.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.860
I see, it was him...

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:05.870
Yes.

00:04:42.070 --> 00:04:42.900
How do you feel?

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:46.570
I'm fine.

00:04:55.080 --> 00:04:55.920
That...

00:04:57.920 --> 00:05:00.920
contains the same information
I handed Monica.

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.470
<i>Is this...</i>

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:52.600
all true?

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:02.110
LIVE did all of this?

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:04.480
His younger brother...

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:09.570
Connor is leading this research.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.250
They're insane.

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:17.910
Him...

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:21.250
and Steven, too.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.340
Such madness...

00:06:26.510 --> 00:06:29.220
if there wasn't a witness,
nobody would believe this.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:35.100
Send them through.

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.850
The transport is ready.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:39.600
Okay.

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:41.270
Why?

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:47.400
Why did Steven do this?

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.410
It's a little chilly.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:01.920
It's almost time.

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.750
Stay low and use us as shields.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:53.550
They're coming.

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:05.980
Now.

00:08:43.310 --> 00:08:44.140
Fred!

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:49.650
Move it! Get more men around Fred!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.030
We failed.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.910
Mr. Faraday, hang in there!

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.420
Damn it!

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:30.940
Once I apply this data...

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.710
It pales in comparison
to a LIVE research facility.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:51.000
But everything is stored inside my head.

00:09:51.290 --> 00:09:52.420
It won't be an issue.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:58.680
What happened?

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:02.180
I doubt this was LIVE...

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.980
but a completely different player
entering the ring.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.900
Steven?

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:14.190
My brother...

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.160
If worse comes to worse...

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:33.170
I suppose...

00:10:33.880 --> 00:10:35.420
it's the only way to save him.

00:10:38.840 --> 00:10:39.680
Where...

00:10:41.850 --> 00:10:43.260
are they taking my brother?

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:48.520
Hey, hang in there!

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:50.980
We're almost there.

00:10:51.400 --> 00:10:53.110
Keep your eyes peeled!

00:10:54.610 --> 00:10:55.900
His levels are dropping!

00:10:56.440 --> 00:10:57.490
Damn it!

00:10:57.570 --> 00:10:59.240
-What about his vitals?
-Not good.

00:11:03.990 --> 00:11:04.950
Don't give up!

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:07.950
Come on, Fred! Fred!

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:20.510
I know already.

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:31.900
Copy that.

00:11:31.980 --> 00:11:33.310
We'll rendezvous there.

00:11:39.820 --> 00:11:41.740
Ouch.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:47.870
I'll kill him.

00:11:53.040 --> 00:11:54.500
Is that all you need?

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.670
This will suffice.

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.340
I'm counting on you.

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:06.010
Please...

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:09.810
He's got a severed carotid artery.
Consciousness level at 100.

00:12:09.890 --> 00:12:12.350
-His vitals are dangerously low.
-Get out of the way!

00:12:19.280 --> 00:12:20.110
Damn it!

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.700
We won't be safe here for long.

00:12:27.660 --> 00:12:28.490
I know.

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:39.380
Now.

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:44.380
Let's try again.

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:50.350
Looking at the way they attacked him...

00:12:52.770 --> 00:12:55.690
they'll be making sure
the job is finished.

00:12:57.400 --> 00:12:59.360
<i>They'll likely attack there eventually.</i>

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:21.630
Twenty-one years.

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:25.680
For LIVE.

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:30.050
No, it's been 21 years...

00:13:31.140 --> 00:13:33.140
since I've been after Steven.

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.740
He is always slipping through my fingers.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:54.080
Perhaps trying to catch him...

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:57.120
was a mistake.

00:14:08.050 --> 00:14:09.090
<i>Well...</i>

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:11.640
that's to be expected.

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:14.100
We don't have much time.

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:17.100
Okay, let's be quick about it then.

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:19.270
Yes, please send reinforcements. Yes.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.070
Please submit your bags for inspection.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.030
Again?

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:33.950
They're here.

00:14:39.960 --> 00:14:42.960
Please continue the operation,
we have things under control.

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.010
Wait, don't move!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.280
Attention all personnel...

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:10.070
<i>armed criminals have entered the hospital.</i>

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:14.780
<i>All staff members, please prioritize</i>
<i>the safety of patients and visitors.</i>

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:17.080
What is happening?

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:18.700
We need to get our patients.

00:15:20.120 --> 00:15:21.710
<i>If you see anyone suspicious...</i>

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:24.710
<i>please seek out an officer for help.</i>

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:27.670
<i>Should the situation become violent...</i>

00:15:28.710 --> 00:15:30.630
we will shoot to kill.

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:32.390
Yikes.

00:15:37.220 --> 00:15:39.350
Sorry, you can blame them.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:47.480
Don't move!

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:49.320
I don't got time for this.

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:52.700
Please stay here!

00:16:49.750 --> 00:16:52.670
Hey, do something. It's not working.

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:57.140
They probably locked the system.

00:16:57.680 --> 00:17:00.640
Fucking useless. Goddamn it.

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:06.100
Let's go.

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:30.380
Damn it.

00:17:32.880 --> 00:17:34.970
Saved me the trouble of finding him.

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.140
Come to daddy.

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:53.150
Die!

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.030
Get down!

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:06.660
That's how they get you.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:11.790
Let's be smart here.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:17.760
Even if he's not dead, the explosion
should've hurt him pretty bad.

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:22.350
I'll make his death slow.

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:49.830
Die!

00:18:58.220 --> 00:18:59.220
I'm going to kill you.

00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:02.720
You can try.

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:13.440
Damn it.

00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:20.570
Hey!

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.290
Ever heard of diversion?

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.250
Sorry, but it's time for you to die.

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.090
Who the hell are you guys?

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:41.090
That's a difficult question.

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.550
We're just your everyday...

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:45.390
quartet.

00:19:46.260 --> 00:19:47.350
Damn it.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:19.260
Fucking brat.

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:28.850
Stop getting in our way.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:33.310
It's over.

00:21:33.040 --> 00:21:35.080
Did they screw up? It doesn't matter.

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.000
I'm sorry, doctor.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:42.340
We'll need to check your ID's.

00:21:44.550 --> 00:21:45.590
That's our ID.

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:09.870
Take him and get him to tell you
where Connor is.

00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:35.390
That's no way to treat someone...

00:22:37.310 --> 00:22:38.640
who came to help.

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:21.910
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
